      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Provider**\n\nI'm currently fleshing out the Python script, `profile_claims.py`. I've decided to anchor the external provider to Google for this demonstration. The code is being written using the `write` tool. Next, I need to outline the structure and begin the import statements.\n\n\n**Constructing the Outline**\n\nI've decided to proceed with Google as the external provider, as I previously mentioned. Now, I'm setting up the core structure of `profile_claims.py`. I'm starting to build out import statements, specifically for a Google API library. I plan to flesh out functions to fetch and normalize profile claims, using the write tool to establish the code, and including placeholder comments for future implementation.\n\n\n",
