        "text": "**Developing OAuth Callback**\n\nI've just finished the `oauth_callback.py` file, handling the OAuth callback with Flask. I'm leveraging Google's `google.oauth2` library to swap authorization codes for tokens. Environment variables securely store the client ID and secret, explicitly identifying Google as the external provider.\n\n\n**Confirming OAuth Implementation**\n\nI've successfully created `oauth_callback.py`, employing Flask for the OAuth callback process. Google's `google.oauth2` library efficiently handles the token exchange, and environment variables securely manage the client ID and secret, explicitly setting Google as the provider, completing the user's initial request.\n\n\n",
